# Vercel turns every file under api/ into a Serverless Function, test files
# included. The Hobby plan caps a deployment at 12 functions and the real
# endpoints already sit exactly on that limit (see CONTEXT.md), so the four
# co-located *.test.ts files pushed the deployment to 16 and it was rejected
# before it built.
#
# Ignoring them here keeps the tests next to the handlers they cover — vitest
# still picks them up locally and in CI, because .vercelignore only affects
# what gets uploaded to Vercel.
api/**/*.test.ts
